-- Carbon Pricing Act 2018 — INDEPENDENT TESTS.
--
-- Expected values were decided from ../source/CPA2018.txt, ../source/PROVENANCE.md
-- and BRIEF.md before any .l4 file was opened; they are recorded, scenario by
-- scenario, in independent-expectations.md (ids in the comments, e.g. [A17]).
-- A failing assertion here is a finding; expected values were not changed to
-- match the encoding.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Helpers (record builders only)`

GIVEN g IS A STRING, t IS A NUMBER, c IS A `Circumstance of emission`
GIVETH A `GHG emission`
`em` g t c MEANS `GHG emission` WITH `gas` IS g, `mass in tonnes` IS t, `circumstance` IS c

`elsewise` MEANS `in any other circumstances`

GIVEN g IS A STRING
GIVETH A NUMBER
`gwp of` g MEANS `the tCO2e of` (`em` g 1 `elsewise`)

GIVEN p IS A BOOLEAN, r IS A BOOLEAN, t IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Registration status`
`st` p r t MEANS `Registration status` WITH `a registered person` IS p, `registered as a reportable facility of the person` IS r, `registered as a taxable facility of the person` IS t

GIVEN d IS A DATE, xq IS A BOOLEAN, xt IS A BOOLEAN, prev IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Transfer of control`
`xfer` d xq xt prev MEANS
    `Transfer of control` WITH
        `date of transfer`                                         IS d
        `X was a registered person of the facility, or had control on 31 December of a trigger year` IS xq
        `the facility was registered as a taxable facility of X`   IS xt
        `reckonable tCO2e in the year before the transfer`         IS prev

GIVEN a          IS A BOOLEAN
      aa         IS A BOOLEAN
      three      IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      mo         IS A BOOLEAN
      moyear     IS A NUMBER
      next2      IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      nonleft    IS A BOOLEAN
      wound      IS A BOOLEAN
      discharged IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Deregistration facts`
`df` a aa three mo moyear next2 nonleft wound discharged MEANS
    `Deregistration facts` WITH
        `ceased to have operational control`                        IS a
        `ceased to operate with no intention to resume within 36 months` IS aa
        `reckonable tCO2e in each of the last 3 consecutive years` IS three
        `a modification was completed`                              IS mo
        `reckonable tCO2e in the year the modification was completed` IS moyear
        `likely tCO2e in each of the next 2 years`                  IS next2
        `no reportable facility remains registered to the person`   IS nonleft
        `wound up, dissolved or otherwise ceased to exist`          IS wound
        `all obligations and liabilities under the Act discharged`  IS discharged

GIVEN many IS A BOOLEAN, same IS A BOOLEAN, contig IS A BOOLEAN, dep IS A BOOLEAN, sector IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Site facts`
`sf` many same contig dep sector MEANS
    `Site facts` WITH
        `carried out on more than one parcel of land`                     IS many
        `the same person has operational control over the activity`       IS same
        `parcels contiguous, adjacent, adjoining, or separated only by a road, pathway, drain or waterway` IS contig
        `a prescribed dependency between the activities on the parcels`   IS dep
        `in a prescribed industry sector`                                 IS sector

GIVEN who IS A STRING, ops IS A BOOLEAN, hs IS A BOOLEAN, env IS A BOOLEAN, rank IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Policy authority`
`pa` who ops hs env rank MEANS
    `Policy authority` WITH
        `person` IS who
        `may introduce and implement operating policies` IS ops
        `may introduce and implement health and safety policies` IS hs
        `may introduce and implement environmental policies` IS env
        `rank of authority` IS rank

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, taxable IS A BOOLEAN, t IS A NUMBER, c IS A MAYBE NUMBER, m IS A MAYBE NUMBER, lastyr IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Emissions year facts`
`yf` y taxable t c m lastyr MEANS
    `Emissions year facts` WITH
        `emissions year`                                     IS y
        `a taxable facility of the registered person in that year` IS taxable
        `reckonable tCO2e in the verified and approved reports` IS t
        `allowance awarded for the year, in tCO2e`           IS c
        `the award's minimum tax per tonne`                  IS m
        `the last emissions year Division 1A applies to`     IS lastyr

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, i IS A NUMBER, lim IS A NUMBER, perm IS A BOOLEAN, ok IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Surrender`
`sur` f i lim perm ok MEANS
    `Surrender` WITH
        `fixed-price carbon credits`                IS f
        `eligible international carbon credits`     IS i
        `the prescribed ICC limit`                  IS lim
        `the Minister permits more ICCs`            IS perm
        `ICCs may be used for that tax and emissions year` IS ok

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, d IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `CPA penalty`
`pen` f m d MEANS `CPA penalty` WITH `fine` IS f, `imprisonment in months` IS m, `continuing, per day` IS d

GIVEN o IS A `CPA offence`
GIVETH A `CPA penalty`
`max first` o MEANS `the maximum penalty for` o `, a second or subsequent offence:` FALSE `, tax figure` 0

GIVEN o IS A `CPA offence`
GIVETH A `CPA penalty`
`max repeat` o MEANS `the maximum penalty for` o `, a second or subsequent offence:` TRUE `, tax figure` 0

GIVEN off IS A BOOLEAN, con IS A BOOLEAN, kc IS A BOOLEAN, kn IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Officer facts`
`of` off con kc kn MEANS
    `Officer facts` WITH
        `an officer, partner, committee member or manager able to influence the conduct` IS off
        `consented, connived or conspired`                               IS con
        `knowingly concerned in or party to it`                          IS kc
        `knew or ought to have known, and did not take all reasonable steps` IS kn

-- [B29] 20,000 t CO2 natural gas + 200 t CH4 process + 1 t SF6 electrical + 5,000 t CO2 vehicle
`the B29 emissions` MEANS
    LIST `em` "Carbon dioxide" 20000 `elsewise`,
         `em` "Methane" 200 `elsewise`,
         `em` "Sulphur hexafluoride" 1 `in manufacturing, installing, using or disposing of electrical equipment`,
         `em` "Carbon dioxide" 5000 `in using a vehicle to transport persons or goods`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, sector IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A `Registration status`, served IS A MAYBE DATE, paid IS A NUMBER, asat IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Facility year`
`fy` y sector s served paid asat MEANS
    `Facility year` WITH
        `emissions year`                         IS y
        `site`                                   IS `sf` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE sector
        `exempted by order under s 74`           IS FALSE
        `emissions`                              IS `the B29 emissions`
        `status at the start of the year`        IS s
        `control will cease before the application is due` IS FALSE
        `controlled for part of the year`        IS TRUE
        `monitoring plan approved`               IS TRUE
        `allowance awarded for the year, in tCO2e` IS NOTHING
        `the award's minimum tax per tonne`      IS NOTHING
        `assessment`                             IS `an assessment under s 21(1)`
        `notice of assessment served on`         IS served
        `tax paid by the last day`               IS paid
        `as at`                                  IS asat

§§ `A. First Schedule — GWP and CO2e`

