#ASSERT `an excluded GHG emission:` (`em` "Methane" 1 `in carrying out AFOLU activities`)       -- [B25]
#ASSERT NOT `an excluded GHG emission:` (`em` "Methane" 1 `as a fugitive emission, not flaring or venting`) -- [B26]
#ASSERT NOT `an excluded GHG emission:` (`em` "Nitrous oxide" 1 `in using any fire protection equipment`) -- [B27]
#ASSERT `a reckonable GHG emission:` (`em` "Carbon dioxide" 1 `elsewise`)                       -- [B28]
#ASSERT `the reckonable tCO2e of` `the B29 emissions` EQUALS 25600                              -- [B29]

