§§ `H. Payment, credits, penalties, refunds, registry`

#ASSERT `the last day to pay the tax for` 2025 `, assessed by` `an assessment under s 21(1)` `, served on` (YMD 2026 8 1) EQUALS YMD 2026 9 30            -- [H1]
#ASSERT `the last day to pay the tax for` 2025 `, assessed by` `an assessment under s 21(1)` `, served on` (YMD 2026 9 15) EQUALS YMD 2026 10 15          -- [H2]
#ASSERT `the last day to pay the tax for` 2025 `, assessed by` `an assessment under s 21(1)` `, served on` (YMD 2026 8 31) EQUALS YMD 2026 9 30           -- [H3]
